# 'slide': the drawing's weapon is far longer than the bone's (a 195 px lance on a 140 px bone) and no placement fits it on
# the canvas when it is swung. In this mode the TIP stays where the bone puts it and the extra length goes back through the
# hand, so the hand holds the shaft near its middle during a strike and returns to the drawing's grip in the guard.
# Every clip then fits. The cost: a thrust looks choked-up (the user disliked exactly that on Zhang Fei's spear), so it is
# used only for the four heroes whose weapons leave no other way.
SLIDE = '원화의 무기가 본보다 훨씬 길어(약 170~200px) 캔버스에 안 들어간다. weapon_mode slide: 무기 끝은 본의 위치 그대로, 남는 길이는 손 뒤로 보낸다. 공격 중에는 손이 자루 가운데쯤을 잡고, 대기에서는 원화의 그립으로 돌아온다.'
